{"name": "KILL BREACH", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>KILL BREACH\u00a0</strong>is a procedurally generated, fast-paced roguelite FPS that combines the ultra fast movement of <strong>Doom Eternal</strong>, the grittiness of <strong>Quake</strong>, and the claustrophobic horde killing of <strong>Black Ops Zombies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"284\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4480140/extras/9cc0bd71d01d9e0e36617c87dd42cb31.poster.avif?t=1790809425\" width=\"690\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4480140/extras/9cc0bd71d01d9e0e36617c87dd42cb31.webm?t=1790809425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4480140/extras/9cc0bd71d01d9e0e36617c87dd42cb31.mp4?t=1790809425\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The alien containment facility has fallen. The aliens have escaped, and humanity is at risk. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re sent into a fortress overrun with hostile creatures.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Make your way through the fortress and kill anything you find. There\u2019s no one left to save.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"284\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4480140/extras/325a6846433c694bd8f74f3689d51f63.poster.avif?t=1790809425\" width=\"690\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4480140/extras/325a6846433c694bd8f74f3689d51f63.webm?t=1790809425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4480140/extras/325a6846433c694bd8f74f3689d51f63.mp4?t=1790809425\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Evolve from a soldier into a weapon.</strong>\u00a0Improve your movement, and abilities. Stack upgrades to build increasingly powerful combinations. The longer you stay alive, the more enemies you\u2019ll have to deal with.\u00a0Push your run further and aim for the highest score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"284\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4480140/extras/d3d6a5a460b5520128ed74030e02ba58.poster.avif?t=1790809425\" width=\"690\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4480140/extras/d3d6a5a460b5520128ed74030e02ba58.webm?t=1790809425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4480140/extras/d3d6a5a460b5520128ed74030e02ba58.mp4?t=1790809425\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Every run is different.</strong> Fight through levels that are randomly generated each time you play, ensuring no two descents into the facility are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Define your challenge before you drop in.</strong> Adjust the room count to change the pace of your run, with fewer rooms leading to faster, more chaotic fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect credits from dead enemies to open weapon crates, which give you weapons ranging from common to legendary rarity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4480140/extras_big/2d96219c14070c04fdd0b23ea8c6aef0.webp?t=1790809425\" height=\"726\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4480140/extras/2d96219c14070c04fdd0b23ea8c6aef0.avif?t=1790809425\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "KILL BREACH is a brutal, fast-paced roguelite FPS where relentless horde shooting meets infinite weapon upgrades. Break into a randomly generated facility where no two runs are the same. Turn yourself into a machine of mass destruction, and RIP apart anything that moves.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4480140/08fef00cadeb3ef9f410cdf294a8ce5099c05a7f/header.jpg?t=1790809425", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "Boomer Shooter", "Roguelike", "Action Roguelike", "FPS", "Shooter"], "developers": "Triple DEV", "publishers": "Triple DEV", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4480140", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "1 October 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/_0nDS4jRx0I", "first_seen": 1790805600.0, "review_rank": 53}